  "Software Details": "Szczegóły oprogramowania",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "Moduł rezerwacji Dash Saas sprawia, że ​​zarządzanie spotkaniami jest proste i bezproblemowe. ",
  "/Month": "/Miesiąc",
  "/Year": "/Rok",
  "Buy Now": "Kup teraz",
  "View Live Demo": "Zobacz demonstrację na żywo",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Uprość swój harmonogram dzięki modułowi rezerwacji Dash SaaS",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Usprawnij swój harmonogram dzięki rezerwacji Dash SaaS. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Świetne doświadczenie klienta",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Zapewnienie doskonałej obsługi klienta jest proste dzięki modułowi rezerwacji Dash Saas. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Łatwa integracja i personalizacja",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Nasz moduł rezerwacji dobrze współpracuje z narzędziami, z których już korzystasz. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Przydatna analityka",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Zdobądź cenne informacje na temat trendów rezerwacji i wyników biznesowych dzięki modułowi analitycznemu Dash Saas Bookings. ",
  "Online Payments": "Płatności internetowe",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Dzięki modułowi rezerwacji Dash Saas klienci mogą szybko i bezpiecznie płacić za swoje spotkania online. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Dlaczego warto wybrać moduły dedykowane?",
